>> title: Fluffy Pancakes
>> description: Classic American breakfast pancakes
>> servings: 4
>> prep time: 10 minutes
>> cook time: 15 minutes
>> tags: breakfast, quick

In a large bowl, whisk together @flour{2%cups}, @sugar{2%tbsp}, @baking powder{2%tsp}, and @salt{1/2%tsp}.

In another bowl, mix @milk{1.5%cups}, @egg{1}, and @melted butter{3%tbsp}.

Pour the wet ingredients into the dry ingredients and stir until just combined.

Heat a #griddle{} or #non-stick pan{} over medium heat.

Pour about a quarter cup of batter onto the griddle for each pancake.

Cook until bubbles form on the surface, about ~{2%minutes}, then flip and cook for another ~{2%minutes}.

Serve with @maple syrup{} and fresh @berries{}.
